      "message": "That\u0027s an indirect dependency from other `tools` components:\n\n```\nbazelisk query \"allpaths(//dm, //src/gpu/ganesh:ganesh_TEST_UTIL)\" --notool_deps --output graph                                            INT ✘  mc \ndigraph mygraph {\n  node [shape\u003dbox];\n  \"//dm:dm\"\n  \"//dm:dm\" -\u003e \"//tools/gpu:ganesh_gl_utils\"\n  \"//dm:dm\" -\u003e \"//tools/flags:common_flags\"\n  \"//dm:dm\" -\u003e \"//tools:ddl_utils\\n//tools/flags:ganesh_flags\"\n  \"//dm:dm\" -\u003e \"//tools/debugger:debugger\"\n  \"//tools/debugger:debugger\"\n  \"//tools/debugger:debugger\" -\u003e \"//src/gpu/ganesh/gl:ganesh_gl_TEST_UTIL\"\n  \"//tools:ddl_utils\\n//tools/flags:ganesh_flags\"\n  \"//tools:ddl_utils\\n//tools/flags:ganesh_flags\" -\u003e \"//src/gpu/ganesh:ganesh_TEST_UTIL\"\n  \"//tools/flags:common_flags\"\n  \"//tools/flags:common_flags\" -\u003e \"//tools/gpu:ganesh_gl_utils\"\n  \"//tools/flags:common_flags\" -\u003e \"//src/gpu/ganesh:ganesh_TEST_UTIL\"\n  \"//tools/gpu:ganesh_gl_utils\"\n  \"//tools/gpu:ganesh_gl_utils\" -\u003e \"//src/gpu/ganesh/gl/glx:glx_factory_TEST_UTIL\\n//src/gpu/ganesh/gl/mac:mac_factory_TEST_UTIL\"\n  [label\u003d\"//bazel/common_config_settings:linux_x64@platforms//os:macos\"];\n  \"//tools/gpu:ganesh_gl_utils\" -\u003e \"//src/gpu/ganesh/gl:ganesh_gl_TEST_UTIL\"\n  \"//src/gpu/ganesh/gl/glx:glx_factory_TEST_UTIL\\n//src/gpu/ganesh/gl/mac:mac_factory_TEST_UTIL\"\n  \"//src/gpu/ganesh/gl/glx:glx_factory_TEST_UTIL\\n//src/gpu/ganesh/gl/mac:mac_factory_TEST_UTIL\" -\u003e \"//src/gpu/ganesh/gl:ganesh_gl_TEST_UTIL\"\n  \"//src/gpu/ganesh/gl:ganesh_gl_TEST_UTIL\"\n  \"//src/gpu/ganesh/gl:ganesh_gl_TEST_UTIL\" -\u003e \"//src/gpu/ganesh:ganesh_TEST_UTIL\"\n  \"//src/gpu/ganesh:ganesh_TEST_UTIL\"\n}\n```\n\nI looked into refactoring TEST_UTIL to depend on ganesh, but I think the interesting thing about it is that it uses different compile flags (`GPU_TEST_UTILS`) to turn on various debug/test bits throughout the